Y OUR VALUES AWARDS INVESTORS RESOURCES Our Story SafeBreach is on a mission to fundamentally change the way organizations manage their defenses and control cyber risk. Our journey began when CEO Guy Bejerano and CTO Itzik Kotler connected over the shared frustration that security leaders could spend a fortune on security controls, yet still be unable to confidently assess their level of preparedness against specific threats. Guy and Itzik quickly began work on a solution to combine the mindset of a CISO with the toolset of a hacker. In 2014, SafeBreach was born with the launch of the industry’s first continuous breach and attack simulation (BAS) platform. In 2025, SafeBreach revealed its next evolution with the launch of the SafeBreach Exposure Validation Platform, which combines its pioneering BAS capabilities with innovative attack path validation to help enterprise security teams measure and address security gaps at the perimeter and beyond. Backed by a world-renowned original threat research team and world-class support, SafeBreach helps enterprises transform their security strategy from reactive to proactive safely and at scale. Our Core Values Customer Obsession They are the reason for all we do Move One Step Ahead Relentlessly proactive To Embrace Challenge As one Do It! Continuously Keep it simple and drive progress forward Turn Big Dreams into Reality Make today’s constraints irrelevant Awards Investors Discover more about SafeBreach. Case Studies See how industry-leading organizations leverage the SafeBreach platform to enhance their security strategy. Learn More Newsroom Stay up-to-date with recent industry news, events, product announcements, and press releases. Learn More Blog Learn about our latest cybersecurity threat research and coverage, product enhancements, insights, tips, and more. Learn More Research Hub Read SafeBreach’s original threat research reports and learn about updates to our Hacker’s Playbook. Learn More SafeBreach Platform See our continuous security validation BAS platform in action. Learn More Careers Join us as we fundamentally change the way the world manages security and cyber risk. Learn More Leverage the Attack to Improve Your Defenses Why SafeBreach Solutions SafeBreach CTEM Platform SafeBreach Helm Exposure Validation Platform Validate Propagate Service & Support SafeBreach-as-a-Service Use Cases Threat Assessment Security Control Validation Cloud Security Assessment Verticals Healthcare Finance Life Sciences IT/OT Environments SafeBreach Labs Labs Research Hub CVE Discoveries Resources Blog Reports & White Papers Solution Briefs Media Center Case Studies On-Demand Webinars Events & Webinars Breach and Attack Simulation MITRE ATT&CK®: The Complete Guide Partners Explore Technology Partners Explore Channel Partners For Partners Partner Portal Company About Leadership Newsroom Careers Contact Us Security Portal Support Portal SafeBreach Labs Request a Demo © Copyrights SafeBreach Inc. 2026 Privacy Policy Website Terms of Use Request a Demo Support Portal Data Processing Addendum End-User Licensing Agreement",
