      "description": "Platform Demo Request | SafeBreach Support Portal SafeBreach Labs search Why SafeBreach Solutions Solutions CTEM Platform SafeBreach Helm Exposure Validation Platform Validate Propagate Service & Support SafeBreach-as-a-Service Solution Brief SafeBreach CTEM Platform Read More Use Cases Use Cases By Need Threat Assessment Security Control Validation Cloud Security Assessment By Industry Finance Healthcare Life Sciences IT/OT Environments Case Study Fortune 500 Energy Provider Enhanced Threat Management & Business Resilience with SafeBreach Read More Resources Resources Resource Center Blog Reports & White Papers Solution Briefs Media Center Case Studies Webinars Research Hub CVE Discoveries Events Guides The State of the Breach Report Continuous Threat Exposure Management (CTEM) Adversarial Exposure Validation CRINK Threat Actors: China, Russia, Iran & North Korea Detection Engineering Automated Penetration Testing Breach & Attack Simulation (BAS) Continuous Automated Red Teaming MITRE ATT&CK Framework Resource See SafeBreach Helm in Action Take a self-guided demo and watch SafeBreach Helm's AI Agents accelerate teams from exposure to remediation. Watch Now Elevate Our Partners Our Partners Explore Technology Partners Explore Channel Partners For Partners Partner Portal Solution Brief SafeBreach & Anvilogic SafeBreach and Anvilogic turn validated findings into detections that get re-validated daily—giving teams audit-grade proof that closed gaps stay closed. Read More Company About SafeBreach About Us Leadership Newsroom Careers Contact Us Security Portal Support Portal SafeBreach Labs The threats aren’t slowing down—neither should you. Learn why enterprise security leaders choose SafeBreach to get a holistic understanding of threat exposure, prioritize data-driven decisions that reduce the greatest risk, and measurably improve cyber resilience—safely and at scale. Operationalize the full CTEM lifecycle with a true closed-loop solution that’s powered by SafeBreach Helm. Continuously test your defenses with 30,000+ attack methods from our patented Hacker’s Playbook. Understand your exposure by category, including MITRE ATT&CK, known attacks, and threat groups. Identify the potential blast-radius of an attack after a network breach. Accelerate your remediation with actionable insights and dozens of technology integrations that seamlessly share data with other tools and systems. Monitor risk with customizable dashboards and reports to measure your baseline, track improvement over time, and align security with business outcomes. Request a Demo Trusted by the World’s Largest Enterprises The Exposure Validation Solution Our Customers Count On “We use SafeBreach to gain a continuous, measurable, and complete view of our security posture. It’s not only invaluable for acquisitions—it also helps keep us safe every day as a key part of our continuous testing and assurance program.” Senior Director of Security Fortune 500 Financial Services Company Read the Case Study “SafeBreach provided the highly comprehensive metrics we needed to assess the state of our cybersecurity. The clarity and lack of ambiguity the solution delivers is brilliant. SafeBreach simulates infiltration, lateral movement, and exfiltration methods. The playbook encapsulates all the major cybersecurity threats. By simulating data breach, data loss, and malware threats, we’re effectively assessing the effectiveness of our patching, network segmentation, security monitoring and detection, and prevention controls.” Head of Information Security Fortune 500 Drug & Device Development Company Read the Case Study “We spend a lot of money on prevention tools, and we were only performing once-a-year penetration tests, which have a limited number of hours and are fairly expensive. With BAS, we saw a real opportunity to ramp up our efforts with continuous testing that could augment our red-team exercises to give us a better understanding of the efficacy of our controls and whether or not we need to tune or replace.” CISO Leading Health Insurance Provider Read the Case Study Why Organizations Choose SafeBreach Enterprise-Grade Safety SafeBreach products are designed to meet the stringent safety and privacy requirements of the world’s most mature enterprise security teams. World-Class Support Our world-renowned threat researchers and award-winning customer success team provide a level of service and support you won’t find anywhere else. A Powerful AEV Combo SafeBreach Validate and Propagate identify security gaps and show what an attacker could accomplish by exploiting them—all from one convenient console. Seamless CTEM Enablement Get a complete, closed loop CTEM solution that utilizes intelligent AI orchestration and your existing tech stack to enable proven, measurable risk reduction. Unique Reporting Capabilities Unique reports help you understand risk exposure with posture scoring, peer benchmarking, executive-level insights, and more. Industry-Leading Playbook Our Hacker’s Playbook has over 30,000 attack methods, boasts the widest MITRE ATT&CK coverage, and is updated within 24 hours of emerging threats. Leverage the Attack to Improve Your Defenses Why SafeBreach Solutions SafeBreach CTEM Platform SafeBreach Helm Exposure Validation Platform Validate Propagate Service & Support SafeBreach-as-a-Service Use Cases Threat Assessment Security Control Validation Cloud Security Assessment Verticals Healthcare Finance Life Sciences IT/OT Environments SafeBreach Labs Labs Research Hub CVE Discoveries Resources Blog Reports & White Papers Solution Briefs Media Center Case Studies On-Demand Webinars Events & Webinars Breach and Attack Simulation MITRE ATT&CK®: The Complete Guide Partners Explore Technology Partners Explore Channel Partners For Partners Partner Portal Company About Leadership Newsroom Careers Contact Us Security Portal Support Portal SafeBreach Labs Request a Demo © Copyrights SafeBreach Inc. 2026 Privacy Policy 